== Trivia ==
*The Wash Spring serves as Coco and [[Coco's Mother|her mother's]] primary source of clean water. It is likely to be the entire village's as well.{{Ref|m|61|16}}
*Contraptions are not found in great number in Coco's village. The Wash Spring is one of the few contraptions nearby.{{Ref|m|3|3}}<ref>''Witch Hat Atelier'' [[Volume 1]] Extra Page: The World of ''Witch Hat Atelier''</ref>
*The activation method of the Wash Spring follows the same principle as the [[Glowstone Path]].{{Ref|[[Archives of Witch Hat Atelier]], Page 146}}
[[File:Anime_S1E01_Iguin_Introduces_Magic.png|250px|thumb|right|<small>Iguin introduces Magic to a young Coco.</small>]]
*[[Iguin]] references the Wash Spring when introducing the concept of [[magic]] to Coco.{{Ref|a|1}}{{Ref|m|1|25}}
**They describe it as "springs of pure water that last for all eternity..."
